                ('bio_text_en', models.TextField(default='<p><strong>DEGHA Houssem Eddine</strong> achieved first place in the Algerian National “My Thesis in 180 Seconds” competition, focusing on digital themes, organized by the Ministry of Higher Education in 2021. He is an accomplished Data Scientist and Developer with over a decade of experience in development and technical training.</p><p>DEGHA’s expertise spans various domains of computer science, including Artificial Intelligence, Information Technology, Software Development, Web Development, Database Management, and Networking. He holds advanced skills in Desktop Application Development, Deep Learning, Natural Language Processing (NLP), Recommendation Systems, and Energy Efficiency. He excels in problem-solving and optimizing complex operations.</p><p>With more than four years of experience as a Computer Science Engineer at the University of Kasdi Merbah - Ouargla, along with additional teaching roles at the University of Ghardaia, DEGHA has demonstrated a strong ability to enhance technical infrastructures and improve workflows, while effectively contributing to the academic community.</p>')),
